The [[Fortuna's Grace]] is a [[Ranger]] [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining a [[Bow and Arrow]] with two [[Lucky Clover]]s. It is an upgrade of the [[Bow and Arrow]], but doesn't inherently deal more damage. It gains a bunch of {{icon/luck}} at the start of battle, enough to raise most weapons' accuracy to 100%, including itself. When the {{icon/star}} weapon at the tip of the arrow crits, the [[Fortuna's Grace]] will hit twice on the next attack.

Weapons don't crit inherently, so some method to make the {{icon/star}} weapon crit will be needed to make the most of the {{icon/star}} weapon ability, most likely the [[Ranger Bag]] or an [[Acorn Collar]]. That said, the damage of the [[Fortuna's Grace]] isn't especially high and the main advantage it confers may well be the {{icon/luck}} itself when playing these {{icon/luck}} crit builds. It provides much more {{icon/luck}} than the two needed [[Lucky Clover]]s would have provided, at the very least.
